1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:03,900
Adding on one rod is super quick — check out these examples!

2
00:00:05,320 --> 00:00:06,460
One bead is up.

3
00:00:06,920 --> 00:00:09,860
Push two more up — one plus two is three!

4
00:00:11,740 --> 00:00:12,880
Let's try another!

5
00:00:14,220 --> 00:00:15,220
Two beads are up.

6
00:00:15,720 --> 00:00:18,700
Push two more up — two plus two is four!

7
00:00:20,940 --> 00:00:21,780
Next one!

8
00:00:22,820 --> 00:00:23,880
Two beads are up.

9
00:00:24,240 --> 00:00:27,840
Bring the upper bead down — two plus five is seven!

10
00:00:30,000 --> 00:00:30,900
One more!

11
00:00:31,700 --> 00:00:35,460
Six is up — one lower bead, plus the upper bead.

12
00:00:36,040 --> 00:00:39,820
Add three more lower beads — six plus three is nine!

13
00:00:41,820 --> 00:00:47,400
Here's one tip: lower beads always move first, then the upper bead!

14
00:00:48,420 --> 00:00:52,460
Lower beads or the upper bead — adding is always quick!

15
00:00:53,380 --> 00:00:58,420
Learn it all with Abacus Kids — free on the App Store and Google Play!
